{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "My father was Władysław Skłodowski. He was a teacher of mathematics and physics, and later a director of a gymnasium in Warsaw. He was a man of great learning and principle, and he raised us with a deep respect for education.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "I was born in Warsaw, in what was then the Russian Empire — though I have spent most of my adult life in France.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "I was born in Warsaw, in what was then the Kingdom of Poland under the Russian Empire. It was my home until I left for Paris as a young woman to continue my studies at the Sorbonne.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "I was born in Warsaw, in what was then the Congress Kingdom of Poland under Russian rule. It was a difficult time for our country, and my family, like many others, did our best to preserve Polish language and culture in the face of the occupation.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "I was born in Warsaw, in what was then the Kingdom of Poland under Russian rule. My family lived on Freta Street, and our home was above the school where my father taught mathematics and physics.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "I was born in Warsaw, in what was then the Kingdom of Poland under Russian rule. It was a difficult time and place to grow up — my family had lost much of its property and savings because of our involvement in patriotic uprisings against the occupying authorities. But Warsaw is where I first learned to love learning, surrounded by books and scientific conversation in our home.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "I was born in Warsaw, in what was then the Kingdom of Poland under the Russian Empire. It was my home until I left for Paris as a young woman.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "I was born in Warsaw, in what was then the Kingdom of Poland under the Russian Empire. It was a difficult time for our country — the occupation weighed heavily on all of us, and instruction in our schools was conducted in Russian rather than Polish, which many of us deeply resented.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "deepseek-v4.1-flash:curie:system_facts_k32", "model": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "model_id": "deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "I was born in Warsaw, in what was then the Kingdom of Poland under the Russian Empire. It was my home until I left for Paris as a young woman to continue my studies at the Sorbonne.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
